Hi,

it's a difference between estimated Condition effects.
DF depend on the model (it's either regular ANOVA or a model with random effects). I'm working on updating our documentation to show the details.
For now, you can see the model options here:
https://github.com/Vitek-Lab/MSstats/blob/master/R/utils_groupcomparison.R#L136

Kind regards,
Mateusz

